<title>BELARUS: Belarus Jan-Oct trade deficit widens to $1.24 bln.</title>
<headline>Belarus Jan-Oct trade deficit widens to $1.24 bln.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belarus's trade deficit widened to $1,239.1 million in the first 10 months of this year from $601.6 million in the same 1995 period, the Statistics Ministry said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>BELARUS MERCHANDISE TRADE  Jan-Oct 96 Jan-Sep 96 Jan-Oct 95</p>
<p>    exports	 ($ million)	 4,329.1    3,875.4    3,831.9</p>
<p>    imports			   5,568.2    5,009.9    4,433.5</p>
<p>    trade balance		  -1,239.1   -1,134.5     -601.6</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
